### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://apimac.zyncbook.com

### ============================
### AUTH (do this first to get token)
### ============================

### Login (Swagger: POST /Account/Authenticate)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/Authenticate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "Aunty1",
  "password": "1234",
  "userType": 3,
  "accessMethod": 0,
  "deviceType": "mobile"
}

### Token helper (VS Code REST Client can resolve it)
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================
### TEST ENDPOINTS (from Swagger)
### ============================

### My Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/Profile/MyInfo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Training Centers
GET {{baseUrl}}/Listing/TrainingCenters
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Branches By Club Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/Account/GetBranchesByClubCode/RTT
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

